  "readme": "# Meshy UV Unwrap\nMeshy UV Unwrap creates a clean UV layout for an existing 3D model before texturing.\n## Fields\n| Field | Type | Default | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `model_url` | string, required | — | URL of the 3D model (GLB, GLTF, FBX, OBJ or STL) as a public URL or data URI. |\n## Output\n- `url`: GLB with new UVs.\n- `thumbnail`: Preview image.\n## Billing\n$0.20 per model. The mesh can have at most 40,000 faces.\n",
